Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.30,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:05.74,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.949,334.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3860,4980)}Episode 34
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:06.06,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3860,4980)\pos(635.949,557.418)}Thatched Boats \NBorrowing Arrows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mou and Zhang Yun were my greatest concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that their heads are off, \NI have nothing left to fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(315.949,510)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2150,2500)}Zhōu Yú \NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.46,0:00:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, your plan was a masterstroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How could Cao Cao oppose you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt any of my generals caught on to my ploy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:56.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.152,459.546)}Lǔ Sù \NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but I suspect Zhuge Liang saw through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, go and test my theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find out if he knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:26.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(949.198,510)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2050,2500)}Zhūgé Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you seem to be relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, what is this chart used for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.98,0:01:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the role of a commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}To unite forces, to lead charges, to suppress threats, and to protect borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:01:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}That is only part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}I'd like to hear your explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Since antiquity, many who have led armies \Nhave styled themselves as great generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Yet, few have understood \Nwhat it means to be an officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}A great leader's power does not come from brute strength alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Mediocre generals focus only on \Nthe size and courage of their army.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Common warlords, the likes of Lü Bu and Yuan Shao, are unworthy of discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}A brilliant commander cannot just know {\bord12.243}themselves and their foe, or how to cleverly utilize troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.55,0:02:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}They must also understand \Nthe weather, geography, and human life;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}predict like the gods, know the Art of War, \Nlead large armies, and still make room for leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}These kinds of great generals includes Sun, Wu, Guan, and Yue;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:53.43,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Referring to Sun Bin, Wu Qi, Guan Zhong, and Yue Yi, of the Eastern Zhou period.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}and in our age, Cao Mengde and Zhou Gongjin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}... even this does not illustrate the way of a great general!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243\pos(640,665.333)}Then what does the way of the general entail?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Any explanation would be too complex, \Nso let me give an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.15,0:03:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}A commander makes use of soldiers, \Nbut the word "soldier" can mean many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}"Soldier" can refer to both visible and invisible troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Visible soldiers are ones wielding halberds, \Nwarriors in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.55,0:03:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Invisible soldiers are the Sun, Moon, and stars; \Nthe wind, clouds, water, fire;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}the auras of mountains and rivers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}In this way, anything can be considered a "soldier"!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}For instance, that {\i1}72 Pentads Chart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:53.77,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: An ancient Chinese meteorological, astronomical, \Nand phenological calendar used to guide agriculture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}This was drawn up by the Duke of Zhou,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:04:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}who divided the days of the year \Ninto various groupings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Five days make up a pentad; \Nthree pentads make up a solar term;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}six solar terms make up a season; \Nfour seasons make up a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}The solar terms reveal the ebb and flow of natural forces, each in turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}When rainbows disappear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}when thunderclaps begin to fade,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}when soil becomes mud, when fog rises!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}If you understand this knowledge intimately,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}if you incorporate it into your very being, \Nthen you may triumph over an army of millions!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.28,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of such lofty topics. \NMay I ask what brings you here, Zijing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been busy with military affairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but I made time just to visit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so absorbed in my studies that I neglected to congratulate the Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulate for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The navy of Jiangdong is rid of a great obstacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you learn about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,His trick could only have fooled the likes of Jiang Gan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.65,0:05:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Cao Cao was deceived at first, \Nhe must have realized it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He only refuses to admit his mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, Cai and Zhang are now dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has appointed Mao Jie \Nand Yu Jin as Navy Commanders to replace them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but those two know nothing of naval warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, their navy will suffer huge losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, please don't tell Gongjin \Nthat I discovered his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that Gongjin would be jealous, \Nand might use it as an excuse to harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you may rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That man must die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I have decided to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not, do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun-Liu alliance is crucial to defeating the Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you turn on your ally, \NI fear Cao Cao would have the last laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If that man is left alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,in time he could become \Na major threat to Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, do not worry. I will find a worthy justification.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He will accept his death without protest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite Master Kongming to my tent for a meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.15,0:07:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kongming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming, take a seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, I will battle the Cao navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what types of weapons should I use?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For a battle on the Yangzi River, \Nbows and arrows would be most effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My thoughts exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But right now, we happen to be short on arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:08:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I ask that you oversee the production of 100,000 arrows to combat the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this is an urgent matter, \NI hope you will not refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will treat the Chief Commander's order as a great honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All I must know is when you expect them by.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, the sooner the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you have them ready in, say... ten days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if that is too daunting, \NI can spare you a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the time for battle draws ever closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,With the battle close at hand, if we wait ten days, \Nwe will miss our opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,in that case, how long do you need to produce 100,000 arrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thre-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can bring you 100,000 arrows, Chief Commander, within three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But in war, there is no room for jests!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a formal military order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If I cannot finish within three days, \NI will accept any punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Put it in writing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it over before you act!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:10:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming is an outstanding prodigy of this era.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this small task be a match for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurrah! Hurrah, Master Kongming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring in wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming, cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, now you have seen the beauty of my plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's signed his own death warrant without provocation!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,With this letter, in three days, \Nhe will be called to the sword and executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Quartermaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It would take half a day just to do inventory on 100,000 arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to keep a close watch on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Provide him with anything he needs to produce the arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After three days pass, he will have nothing but himself to blame!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, go and see what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I must know how he plans to produce 100,000 arrows within three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Sleeping Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Sleeping Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you sure are taking it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, you have to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.85,0:12:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you brought this on yourself. \NHow am I supposed to save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for your betrayal,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,how could I have ended up in this desperate position?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say such nonsense! \NWhy are you blaming me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you not to tell Gongjin that I knew about the deaths of Cai and Zhang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but you told him anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I am suffering the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,100,000 arrows...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,... Even with {\i1}thirty{\i0} days, it would be hard to pull off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You might have been spared, \Nhad you not signed the formal order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you will help me, Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Helping you with this is beyond my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were in Jiangxia, didn't you make a promise to my lord, Liu of Yu Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you let me down now, in my moment of need?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu Zijing, I have often heard it said \Nthat you are a devoted and righteous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:13:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems those were just false rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When you put it that way, \Nperhaps I have acted unjustly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Within three days, I can send for a warship and return you to Xiakou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}How could I flee in the face of such a challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}And how would I explain it to my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.03,0:14:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}Zijing, I only ask that you lend me 20 boats,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}each manned by 30 soldiers with drums and instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Further, have 1,000 straw men \Nwrapped in black cloth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.57,0:14:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}and line them up along the sides of each ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}I shall make wonderful use of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Do this, and we will have the 100,000 arrows ready on the third day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:14:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This task will be no trouble for me. \NConsider it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.35,0:15:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, this time, my life is at stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not tell Gongjin of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, my strategy will fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you may rest assured!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly go and invite Master Lu. \NDo not let anyone notice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, the three-day limit for the arrows is almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you have finished them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, don't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me to the boat's cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:16:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:16:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask why you invited me here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I fail to have the 100,000 arrows by tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,would you be able to shield me from harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I urged you to escape before, \Nbut you refused to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, I do not know how I could help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it seems I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At third watch, we shall set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:42.55,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Third watch: between 11:00 PM and 1:00 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.55,0:17:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The north bank of this Great Yangzi River, \Ntowards the Cao naval camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you luring me into some wicked plot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, fog is rising on the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the boats! Stop the boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, why are you so worked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, remember my promise of loyalty to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:19:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There is still time to flee to Jiangxia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Or if you return to Sanjiangkou, then I will risk my own life to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But we must not go to the Cao camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing's words are grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems your heart is wavering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I play a tune from the {\i1}qin{\i0} for your comfort?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in no mood for this nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring us back, right this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, is that the wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.35,0:21:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just the sound of the river. Go on back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:34.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(953.249,470.454)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2320,2660)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, the Cao naval camp is just ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the torches! Light the torches!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cao naval camp is right ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If we are seen, won't we be inviting our own deaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.70,0:22:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kongming! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.72,0:22:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.15,0:23:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:30.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(987.004,474.546)\fade(255,0,255,0,0,1790,2140)}Máo Jiè \NStyled: Xiàoxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ships from Eastern Wu are nearing the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw their lamps flickering through heavy fog. There are countless enemy ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao Jie, Yu Jin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.06,0:23:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You two shall lead the navy to oppose the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.46,0:23:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A heavy fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.06,0:23:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The fog in the river is thick, we can only see their lamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavy fog veils the river, \Nand our foe suddenly appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be an ambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.46,0:24:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not move our navy recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Order our soldiers to shoot at will. \NDrive off the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.46,0:24:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.30,0:24:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.06,0:25:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrows fall like rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.34,0:25:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If their navy comes after us, what will happen then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.46,0:25:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The heavy fog obscures the river. \NOur foe dares not approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.58,0:25:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us have our wine and enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.82,0:25:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll return when the fog clears.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.14,0:25:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the boats closer to their camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.42,0:25:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose! Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.02,0:26:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.54,0:26:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go tell Commander Mao that the enemy ships are closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.86,0:26:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Send for reinforcements to aid us! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.22,0:26:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.82,0:26:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.82,0:26:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, our archers have sent volley after volley,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Wu army is still advancing! \NThey are up to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.26,0:26:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we send in our navy, we can drive them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.14,0:26:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That whelp Zhou Yu is trying to lure us out with childish tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.54,0:27:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Our navy shall not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.58,0:27:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Liao, Xu Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.82,0:27:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.74,0:27:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go lead 3,000 crossbowmen to reinforce our defenses!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.62,0:27:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.06,0:27:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.58,0:27:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, towards the river bank!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.74,0:27:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.34,0:28:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,These arrows...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.02,0:28:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,These arrows are enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can drink our wine when we get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.58,0:28:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, why so afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.06,0:28:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is tonight's entertainment, \Nand there is still more to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.82,0:29:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot them! Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.86,0:29:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The boat is going to capsize!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.86,0:29:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the boats around!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.06,0:29:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.66,0:29:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the boats around!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.06,0:31:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Zijing, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.66,0:31:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, dawn is breaking and the fog is clearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.50,0:31:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the ships return.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.98,0:31:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the soldiers to shout, \N"We thank Chancellor Cao for the arrows!" in unison.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.42,0:31:58.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.86,0:32:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shooting! Stop shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.10,0:32:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shooting! We fell into their trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.42,0:32:15.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Stop shooting! Stop shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.30,0:33:05.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,We thank Chancellor Cao for the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.66,0:33:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.82,0:33:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us return at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.18,0:34:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We thank Chancellor Cao for the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.22,0:34:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They have played me for a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.78,0:35:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, each boat has five or six thousand arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.82,0:35:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be over 100,000 in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.62,0:35:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, will these arrows be enough to satisfy Gongjin?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.94,0:35:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did you know there would be such heavy fog today?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.74,0:35:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243\pos(640,665.333)}The other day, we discussed the way of the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.66,0:35:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}A commander who fails to understand \Nthe patterns of Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.06,0:35:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}the advantages of terrain, \Nthe flow of {\i1}yin {\i0}and {\i1}yang,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.98,0:35:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}the {\i1}Qímén Dùnjiǎ,{\i0} battle formations, \Nor military strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.98,0:35:45.02,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Qímén Dùnjiǎ (奇门遁甲) is an ancient Chinese esoteric book on astronomy and divinations, as well as strategy, law, and early natural science.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.74,0:35:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}will be doomed to mediocrity!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.06,0:35:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Three days ago, I anticipated there would be a heavy fog shrouding the river today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.58,0:35:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243\pos(640,665.333)}Thus, I dared take three days as my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.06,0:35:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.243}Gongjin told me to make 100,000 arrows within ten days,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.82,0:36:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}but how could anyone accomplish such a task?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.42,0:36:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}It was clear that he wanted me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.86,0:36:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}Pity that my life is in accordance to the Heaven's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.58,0:36:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,665.333)}How could Gongjin harm me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.66,0:36:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you truly are a divine man!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.58,0:37:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongming is a miraculous strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.22,0:37:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I... cannot compare!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.30,0:37:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.70,0:37:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.50,0:37:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, Master Kongming has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.06,0:37:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.50,0:37:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.22,0:38:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, your divine calculations \Nare an incredible achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.26,0:38:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have more than earned my respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.38,0:38:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a simple ruse, \Nhardly worthy of such praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.42,0:38:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chief Commander is cunning, \Nand a far more talented general.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.22,0:38:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am humbled. I am humbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.46,0:38:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the arrows are ready, may I ask when we set off to defeat the Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.98,0:38:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, the Marquis of Wu urged me to advance my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.58,0:38:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I lack a clever strategy to assure our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.38,0:38:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I appeal to you for your advice, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.94,0:38:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, you have been strategizing behind closed doors for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.06,0:38:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain you already have something in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.66,0:38:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I inspected the Cao naval camp, which \Nfollowed the standards of Cai and Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.82,0:39:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They are most disciplined and orderly. \NNo ordinary plan could defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.46,0:39:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea, but I am not sure if it will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.38,0:39:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you, sir, will decide on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.14,0:39:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a crucial matter of war; \Nlet us not speak of this out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.42,0:39:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let each of us write our plans on our palms.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.86,0:39:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we see if they are in concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.66,0:39:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring us brush and ink!
